## ✅ Steps to Reproduce:
1. Click “Join Jobrowse” on the homepage and enter full name, e-mail, and phone number.  
2. Receive e-mail with discount code START2026 and link “CHECK IT OUT NOW”.  
3. Click on “CHECK IT OUT NOW” → redirected back to the homepage.  
4. Scroll down and click “View plans” → plans for job seekers and employers are visible, but **cannot be clicked**, plans cannot be selected or purchased, discount code cannot be applied.  
5. Scroll to blog post: https://www.jobrowse.com/blog/jobrowse-introduction → the clickable line “Sign up for the Jobrowse waiting list today” again leads only to e-mail subscription.  

---

## ✅ Expected Result:
- After selecting a plan, the user should be able to: create a Jobrowse Offer, select the work model, make a payment (if required), and apply the discount code.  
- Buttons and navigation should be fully interactive and functional.  

---

## ✅ Actual Result:
- Plan selection buttons do not work.  
- Cannot create a Jobrowse Offer.  
- Discount code cannot be applied.  
- No functional login/account button available.  
- All interactive elements (plans, blog links, navigation buttons) either non-clickable or redirect back to homepage.  

